OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in southern
OL,6,Fareas this morning with patchy light
OL,7,Frain and drizzle. This soon easing and
OL,8,Fturning dry with sunnier skies across
OL,9,FCumbria and Lancashire this morning
OL,10,Fspreading south to most areas this
OL,11,Fafternoon. Lighter winds than
OL,12,Fyesterday.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear skies this evening and
OL,15,Fremaining dry and largely clear
OL,16,Fovernight. Quickly turning cold with a
OL,17,Fwidespread and locally sharp frost
OL,18,Fdeveloping overnight. Patchy freezing
OL,19,Ffog developing in the countryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
